load @term/seed/code/structure/ring
  find ring

# A filtered algebra: an algebra with an increasing chain of subspaces whose products respect the chain (degree at most
# m times degree at most n lands in degree at most m plus n), a looser cousin of a graded algebra where degrees only
# bound rather than add exactly. The universal enveloping algebra of a Lie algebra is filtered, and its associated
# graded algebra is the symmetric algebra. The form carries the underlying ring.
form filtered-algebra
  link ring, like ring
